1e:T4bb,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-marketing-automation#webpage","url":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-marketing-automation","name":"Agent IA vs Marketing Automation : différences clés B2B","description":"Découvrez les différences entre un agent IA autonome et le marketing automation. Adaptabilité vs répétition : quel impact sur vos campagnes B2B ?","inLanguage":"fr-FR","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/#organization"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-marketing-automation#breadcrumb"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Accueil","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Ressources agent IA","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Agent IA vs Marketing Automation : quelle différence ?","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-marketing-automation"}],"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-marketing-automation#breadcrumb"}]}15:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1e"}}],["$","$L1f",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 prose prose-invert","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-6","children":[["$","$L20",null,{"href":"/","children":"Accueil"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","$L20",null,{"href":"/agent-ia","children":"Agent IA"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Agent IA vs Marketing Automation : quelle différence ?"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight mb-4","children":"Agent IA vs Marketing Automation : quelle différence ?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-neutral-400 mb-12","children":["Publié le ","16/05/2026"," · ",12," min de lecture"," · ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":"agent ia marketing automation"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Un agent IA autonome raisonne, prend des décisions et enchaîne des actions en temps réel selon le contexte de chaque prospect — sans intervention humaine. Une plateforme de marketing automation exécute des séquences prédéfinies déclenchées par des règles fixes. La différence fondamentale : l'agent IA s'adapte, le marketing automation répète. Pour les cycles de vente B2B complexes, cette distinction détermine directement la qualité de l'engagement et le taux de conversion."}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"agent-ia-vs-marketing-automation--la-différence-en-une-phrase","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#agent-ia-vs-marketing-automation--la-différence-en-une-phrase","children":"Agent IA vs marketing automation : la différence en une phrase"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["Une plateforme de marketing automation ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"exécute des workflows programmés"}]," ; un agent IA ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"raisonne et agit de façon autonome"}]," selon le contexte réel de chaque interaction — sans qu'une règle ait été écrite à l'avance pour chaque situation."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"ce-que-fait-réellement-une-plateforme-de-marketing-automation","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#ce-que-fait-réellement-une-plateforme-de-marketing-automation","children":"Ce que fait réellement une plateforme de marketing automation"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Une plateforme de marketing automation exécute des séquences d'actions prédéfinies déclenchées par des événements précis : ouverture d'un email, visite d'une page, téléchargement d'un livre blanc. Elle ne décide pas — elle applique des règles que vos équipes ont configurées en amont."}],"\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n","$L30","\n","$L31","\n","$L32","\n","$L33","\n","$L34","\n","$L35","\n","$L36","\n","$L37","\n","$L38","\n","$L39","\n","$L3a","\n","$L3b","\n","$L3c","\n","$L3d","\n","$L3e","\n","$L3f","\n","$L40","\n","$L41","\n","$L42","\n","$L43","\n","$L44","\n","$L45","\n","$L46","\n","$L47","\n","$L48","\n","$L49","\n","$L4a","\n","$L4b","\n","$L4c","\n","$L4d","\n","$L4e","\n","$L4f","\n","$L50","\n","$L51","\n","$L52","\n","$L53","\n","$L54","\n","$L55","\n","$L56","\n","$L57","\n","$L58","\n","$L59","\n","$L5a","\n","$L5b","\n","$L5c","\n","$L5d","\n","$L5e","\n","$L5f","\n","$L60","\n","$L61","\n","$L62","\n","$L63","\n","$L64","\n","$L65","\n","$L66","\n","$L67","\n","$L68","\n","$L69","\n","$L6a","\n","$L6b","\n","$L6c","\n","$L6d","\n","$L6e","\n","$L6f","\n","$L70","\n","$L71","\n","$L72","\n","$L73","\n","$L74","\n","$L75","\n","$L76"]}],"$L77","$L78","$L79","$L7a"]}],"$L7b"]
